{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨晚（20日）11時許，警方接獲多名市民報案，指黃竹坑南朗山道大王爺廟發生火警，大量濃煙冒出。</p><p>消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約10分鐘後將火救熄。</p><p>消防經初步調查，相信香火燒著附近鐵架雜物，事件中無人受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:34.162574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:22:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:42.412728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:49.156324+00:00","content_hash":"d3935996e0d8b5bca01690e8a463facb5279e20ea0c6f6f535a990e141879feb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}